{"3226460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scar-Lead Salvation", "steam_appid": 3226460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226460/extras/b99e0a8025c0f5c17c3089a61c457699.avif?t=1776732521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226460/extras_big/b99e0a8025c0f5c17c3089a61c457699.avif?t=1776732521 width=800 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get everything you'll need to escape the mechanized military facility with the Scar-Lead Salvation Deluxe Edition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Deluxe Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Digital Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Digital Art Book (44 Pages)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Digital Soundtrack (32 Tracks)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Art Book and Soundtrack can be accessed in the folder where the game is installed.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Willow Martin awakens with no memories in an unfamiliar room, she can't figure out how she got there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without any semblance of who she is or where she came from, can she trust the AI who aids her? Or is it her enemy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So begins her deadly battles against mechanical weapons in a bid to escape. But what truths lie at the end?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live. Die. Repeat.</strong> – Death may seem inevitable as you progress through the story, but it's not the end. With each death you'll resurrect where it all started—and maybe learn a little about what happened here in the process. Escape this loop and discover the truth about the military facility and Willow's past!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expect the Unexpected</strong> – You'll never know what comes next as you make your way through the military facility. Each floor will present a procedurally generated layout complete with new enemies to face and equipment to grab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Armed and Operational</strong> – You'll encounter a veritable armada of mechanical foes in the mysterious military facility. Use a variety of weapons, take advantage of status effects, and power up with unique skills to take them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited Power!</strong> – Dodge and parry enemy attacks with precision to build up Exo Force. When enough Exo Force is built up, unleash your ultimate power with Onslaught Mode and become temporarily invincible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Willow Martin awakens with no memories in an unfamiliar room, she can't figure out how she got there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without any semblance of who she is or where she came from, can she trust the AI who aids her? Or is it her enemy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So begins her deadly battles against mechanical weapons in a bid to escape. But what truths lie at the end?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live. Die. Repeat.</strong> – Death may seem inevitable as you progress through the story, but it's not the end. With each death you'll resurrect where it all started—and maybe learn a little about what happened here in the process. Escape this loop and discover the truth about the military facility and Willow's past!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expect the Unexpected</strong> – You'll never know what comes next as you make your way through the military facility. Each floor will present a procedurally generated layout complete with new enemies to face and equipment to grab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Armed and Operational</strong> – You'll encounter a veritable armada of mechanical foes in the mysterious military facility. Use a variety of weapons, take advantage of status effects, and power up with unique skills to take them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited Power!</strong> – Dodge and parry enemy attacks with precision to build up Exo Force. When enough Exo Force is built up, unleash your ultimate power with Onslaught Mode and become temporarily invincible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Play as Willow, who awakens in a deserted military facility with no memory of how she got there, accompanied only by an AI in her ear and a swarm of deadly robots. Can you uncover the mystery of what happened in the facility, learn about Willow's past, and make your way out alive?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226460/7ec76629430192f6055f857ff5f3c2cf0ca52ea9/header.jpg?t=1776732521", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226460/f9587dcc5187e148a79dc8f9f1a64cb51f1f0477/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776732521", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226460/f9587dcc5187e148a79dc8f9f1a64cb51f1f0477/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776732521", "website": "https://ifi.games/game/scar-lead-salvation/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><stro